rt the  possibility that war crimes were being  committed now back in May and so why do  you think it's taken quite so long to  get to this point  well actually the whole case started  more than five years ago and we were  always wondering why it took them  to open investigations and to start in  the process of investigations given that  the crimes that Israel has been  committing on in the occupied  Palestinian territory are very obvious  including the crime of the transfer of  its own citizens into the occupied  Palestinian territory which is a war  crime under their own statute that has  been noticed by the Palestinian  government but nonetheless we will come  this as a first step forward in order to  grant the victims of those crimes  justice as soon as possible and to bring  them punished what are you hoping to  achieve here you're talking about trying  to fight for justice but in terms of  actual concrete measures I mean that  this investigation could take some time  what are you actually hoping to see out  of the ICC well we're hoping that the  ICC will hold those who are committing  crimes against our people against our  land and the crimes that are outlined in  the Rome Statute accountable to their  crimes and that no more crimes are being  committed on the Palestinian land which  will basically set the stage for ending  occupation and thus opening the path for  a conclusion of this conflict otherwise  if Israel continues to conduct its  crimes on our land without any with  impunity and without any accountability  we believe that this conflict will be  perpetuated forever and there is no  solution to it so the court and its role  it will provide peace to this land  revolving those criminals and those who  allow for these crimes to be committed  in the occupied Palestinian territory  accountable to their hands so from what  you're saying there sir you're saying  that you view this this entire ICC  investigation whatever happens next as  part of a peace process well it is part  of justice to the Palestinian people  this process was intended to achieve  justice the Palestinian people and just  this is what we seek what we seek is an  end to the oppression duda tyranny that  is being exerted and  to the punishments and and to the  violations of human rights and and  rights of Palestinian people left and  right by the Israeli government with  with no one holding it accountable at a  national level or an international level  discord was established to to hold  accountable those who committed the most  violent of crimes that choke you in the  International humanity a humanity  conscience accountable to their crimes  so we believe that justice is what we  see and we hope that justice is what we  what prevail then let me ask you one  more question mr. Hijazi beyond the idea  of justice and people would say well  some people would argue that  international justice is I guess a less  tactile less tangible thing for people  on the ground than perhaps a state what  are you hoping to get out of this in  terms of concrete measures for people in  the Palestinian territories concrete  measures is accountability holding  Israel accountable to its crimes meaning  that ending all violations that are  being committed ending the expansion of  settlement and ending the theft of land  and in the destruction of homes ending  the kill the killing of our children  without anyone being held accountable  those are the concrete measures that we  hope to hold and and all of these  together will grant a sense of justice  the Palestinian people and that someone  out there cares about their faith and  that someone is paying a price for  violations committed against them this  is the truth of the matter and  difference Israel continues to have a  free hand in committing these crimes  without being held accountable there is  no hope in achieving neither peace nor  any future of ending this conflict  I'm a hijazi there the Assistant  Minister for multilateral affairs for  the state of Palestine thank you sir for  joining us on al-jazeera  thank you
 

